# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC. These files stay on Lamont's disk and out of it.
#
# They are the same files .vercelignore keeps off the live site, for the same
# reason — they are internal working documents, not product:
#
#   CONTEXT.md   business validation notes, the open questions, and the fact
#                that this started with Lamont's autistic niece. Family detail
#                that is nobody else's business.
#   VOICE.md     how we talk about the reader. Reads badly if the reader finds it.
#   CLAUDE.md    pricing rationale, launch strategy, unbuilt security plans.
#   SCOPE.md     the licensing boundary and the reasoning behind it. Nothing to
#                hide, but it is internal legal thinking, not a customer document.
#   supabase-setup.sql  maps the schema and bucket rules. Nothing secret in it,
#                but no reason to hand it to anyone who guesses the filename.
#   docs/RESOURCE.md          the rules for the free resource platform.
#   docs/platform-design.html the design rationale behind it. Same class as the
#                four above: internal working documents, not product.
#
# docs/facts.json is NOT here on purpose. It is operational data with public
# source URLs and nothing internal in it, and the pages have to read it at
# runtime, so it has to be versioned and shipped.
#
# If this repo is ever made private, revisit — they are useful to have versioned.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
CONTEXT.md
VOICE.md
SCOPE.md
supabase-setup.sql
supabase-setup-2.sql
docs/RESOURCE.md
docs/platform-design.html

# Never commit secrets or build/deploy scratch.
.env
.env.*
.vercel
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env.check
